  "changes": [
    "Workspace members restricted to sqlite, hopos, core and s3.",
    "HopOS SDK dependency advanced from alpha.16 to alpha.18 for the platform RNG; Lean S3 tag aligned to v3.1.2.",
    "Production snapshot compatibility: bounded manifests up to 16 MiB and 32768 parts; original upstream SHA-256 entries retained, local patch hashes recorded separately.",
    "Restore preserves segment/page order while coalescing contiguous page writes into bounded 64 KiB RPC batches.",
    "Generation retention uses delimiter listings and bounded deletion batches; preserve current and metadata-before-data deletion. Native S3 uses the pinned Lean keep-alive client.",
    "Replica publish split into Batch::stage/upload/finish and Replica::begin/finish so the parts upload runs on its own stack while SQL continues; identical to upstream ../replica (2026-10-02).",
    "Synced to upstream 9da2578 plus Derek's uncommitted simplification of 2026-10-04 (prepare without dirty-log recovery, replication fixes, upload identity, new soak tests); the local patches (manifest limits, delimiter retention, restore coalescing, dependency pins) re-applied on top, maintenance.rs and tests/formats.rs three-way merged."
